### Composition
System.Management.Automation.RemoteException
- One dominant thesis per viewport-scale field.
- Alternate calm pale-blue or warm-paper reading fields with navy proof stages.
- Green owns analytical wins; orange frames and guides rather than filling every
  metric.
- Use 14-16px corners for major data surfaces and pills only for compact controls.
- Motion should explain state: reveal, wipe, swipe, bar growth, or verified
  particle assembly. Reduced-motion users receive the complete final state.
- Never reconstruct the logo or substitute a letter badge.
